hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"257","[AI-translation] Nek-bad koi na laangh sake aise Allah ke kamil kalimaat ki panah chahta hun—us ne jo paida, phailaya aur banaya us ke shar se; aasman se jo utre us ke shar se; us mein jo chadhe us ke shar se; zameen mein jo phailaya us ke shar se; us se jo nikle us ke shar se; raat-din ke fitnon ke shar se; har raat aane wale ke shar se—bhalai lekar aane wale ke siwa; ae Rahman. [Sham ko darr ke waqt padhe]"
